{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Then arose</b> — and Zerubbabel — he is so called because of the people of Zion, who are dwelling in Babylon." "<b>son of Shealtiel</b> — he was not his father; rather Shealtiel his uncle raised him, therefore he is called his son. And so it is written in Chronicles: \"And the sons of Jechoniah the captive: Shealtiel his son, and Malchiram, and Pedaiah, and the sons of Pedaiah: Zerubbabel and Shimei.\" And so the sons of Merab daughter of Saul are called the sons of Michal, for she raised them."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:41:45.145280169Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}